{"seq":10,"slug":"lc0028-find-index-of-first-occurrence","title":"LeetCode 28 找出字符串中第一个匹配项的下标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0028-find-index-of-first-occurrence","wordCount":662,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-28-找出字符串中第一个匹配项的下标\">LeetCode 28 找出字符串中第一个匹配项的下标</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你两个字符串 <code>haystack</code> 和 <code>needle</code>，请你在 <code>haystack</code> 字符串中找出 <code>needle</code> 字符串的第一个匹配项的下标（下标从 0 开始）。如果 <code>needle</code> 不是 <code>haystack</code> 的一部分，则返回 <code>-1</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= haystack.length, needle.length &lt;= 10⁴</code></li>\n<li><code>haystack</code> 和 <code>needle</code> 仅由小写英文字母组成</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：haystack = &quot;sadbutsad&quot;, needle = &quot;sad&quot;&#10;输出：0&#10;解释：&quot;sad&quot; 在下标 0 和 6 处匹配，第一个匹配项的下标是 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：haystack = \"sadbutsad\", needle = \"sad\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：\"sad\" 在下标 0 和 6 处匹配，第一个匹配项的下标是 0</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：haystack = &quot;leetcode&quot;, needle = &quot;leeto&quot;&#10;输出：-1&#10;解释：&quot;leeto&quot; 没有在 &quot;leetcode&quot; 中出现\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：haystack = \"leetcode\", needle = \"leeto\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：\"leeto\" 没有在 \"leetcode\" 中出现</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>字符串匹配是计算机科学中的经典问题，从朴素方法到高效算法，有多种解决方案。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：朴素匹配（暴力法）</strong></p>\n<p>最直接的方法是对 <code>haystack</code> 的每个位置尝试匹配 <code>needle</code>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从 <code>haystack</code> 的第 0 位开始，逐个字符与 <code>needle</code> 比较</li>\n<li>如果在某个位置所有字符都匹配，返回该起始位置</li>\n<li>如果匹配失败，回退到下一个起始位置重新开始</li>\n<li>遍历完所有可能的起始位置（<code>0</code> 到 <code>n - m</code>）后返回 <code>-1</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种方法在最坏情况下时间复杂度为 O(n × m)，但在实际应用中，由于字符不匹配通常在前几个字符就会发生，平均性能往往比理论复杂度好得多。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：KMP 算法</strong></p>\n<p>KMP（Knuth-Morris-Pratt）算法的核心思想是<strong>利用已匹配的信息避免重复比较</strong>。当匹配失败时，不需要回退 <code>haystack</code> 的指针，而是根据预计算的&quot;部分匹配表&quot;（也叫 <code>next</code> 数组或失败函数）跳转 <code>needle</code> 的指针。</p>\n<p>KMP 的核心是构建 <code>next</code> 数组，<code>next[i]</code> 表示 <code>needle[0..i]</code> 的最长相等前后缀长度。有了这个数组，匹配失败时可以直接跳到正确位置，避免无效回退。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素匹配</td>\n<td>O(n × m)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>逐位尝试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KMP</td>\n<td>O(n + m)</td>\n<td>O(m)</td>\n<td>利用前后缀信息跳转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boyer-Moore</td>\n<td>O(n / m) 最优</td>\n<td>O(σ)</td>\n<td>从右向左匹配 + 坏字符规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rabin-Karp</td>\n<td>O(n + m) 平均</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>滚动哈希比较</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 n 为 haystack 长度，m 为 needle 长度，σ 为字符集大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：朴素匹配</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function strStr(haystack: string, needle: string): number {&#10;  const n = haystack.length;&#10;  const m = needle.length;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt;= n - m; i++) {&#10;    let matched = true;&#10;&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; m; j++) {&#10;      if (haystack[i + j] !== needle[j]) {&#10;        matched = false;&#10;        break;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (matched) return i;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return -1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> strStr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">haystack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">needle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> haystack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> needle.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matched </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (haystack[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> needle[j]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        matched </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (matched) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方法二：KMP 算法</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function strStrKMP(haystack: string, needle: string): number {&#10;  const n = haystack.length;&#10;  const m = needle.length;&#10;  const next = buildNext(needle);&#10;&#10;  let j = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    while (j &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; haystack[i] !== needle[j]) {&#10;      j = next[j - 1];&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (haystack[i] === needle[j]) {&#10;      j++;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (j === m) {&#10;      return i - m + 1;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return -1;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function buildNext(pattern: string): number[] {&#10;  const m = pattern.length;&#10;  const next = new Array(m).fill(0);&#10;  let len = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; m; ) {&#10;    if (pattern[i] === pattern[len]) {&#10;      len++;&#10;      next[i] = len;&#10;      i++;&#10;    } else if (len &gt; 0) {&#10;      len = next[len - 1];&#10;    } else {&#10;      next[i] = 0;&#10;      i++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return next;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> strStrKMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">haystack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">needle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-da